category: Devel
requires: pkg-config
sdesc: "SDL3 image loading library for Win32 toolchain"
ldesc: "SDL_image is a simple library to load images of various formats
 as SDL surfaces. It can load BMP, GIF, JPEG, LBM, PCX, PNG, PNM (PPM/PGM/PBM),
 QOI, TGA, XCF, XPM, and simple SVG format images. It can also load AVIF,
 JPEG-XL, TIFF, and WebP images, depending on optional libraries."

